{"ts":"2026-06-06T05:04:53.481Z","author":"codex-telemetry-batch","op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-06-06T05:04:53.481Z","author":"codex-telemetry-batch","text":"Implemented pm telemetry local analytics command surface: pm telemetry status/flush/stats/clear wired in CLI registration, command help content, SDK contracts, MCP pm_run action=telemetry dispatch, and refreshed contracts snapshot. New command behavior: status reports queue depth + endpoint + last flush metadata; stats groups queued events by command with --limit; flush triggers inline queue flush and reports before/after depth; clear disables telemetry and removes runtime queue/state artifacts. Added dedicated unit coverage at tests/unit/commands/telemetry-command.spec.ts plus release-readiness + MCP contract parity tests. Manual temp-dir smoke (dist CLI) executed status/stats/flush/clear/status in a fresh PM_PATH+PM_GLOBAL_PATH sandbox and confirmed clear leaves telemetry disabled with queue_entries=0 and no runtime telemetry artifacts."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-06-06T05:04:53.481Z"}],"before_hash":"84f8f84fb5165bdd5899c0bf21d4dbb7196e1fee6dff147cfc13718a201a5452","after_hash":"6db4f3f91561e97bf4827221cbfb8c3ded522ea50a33174fc63103f95c2e24dd"}
